def arm_fingers(V, T, phi, br, recs, names, by_id, prm, doc):
    """30 October 2026 : THE FINGER THAT THE MERGE TREE HIDES. The merge tree (ZrlTubes.branches) lets the piece with the farthest tip go on (elder rule) : in a hand, the finger whose tip is the farthest is not a branch of its own, it is the tip of the ARM branch, so the hand got one finger fewer than the model has (Manny : 3 fingers and a thumb found, 4 and a thumb on the mesh). This gives that finger its own tube : its tip is the tip of the arm record, its base the highest saddle of the other fingers of the same hand, its vertices the piece of the mesh above that distance that holds the tip. Returns the reports of the tubes built."""
